[1m[38;5;231mWhich environments should the settings module define?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mlocal, staging, production (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mThe common three. localhost maps to local, a staging host maps to staging, everything else to production.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m local, production
